+- id: clock-sweep-report-refusal-needs-per-pr-cause
+  subsystem: ci
+  lifecycle: active
+  files: [".github/workflows/**", "package.json"]
+  fact: >-
+    When the clock-sweep-report (merge the shards, classify, deliver) gate refuses a pull request,
+    read that pull request's failed job step and its repair diff before choosing a remedy. A refusal
+    that was later repaired does not establish a shared cause. Record the observed failing step and
+    the change that cleared it so the next worker acts on the actual failure.
+  evidence: >-
+    The ci-learning finding for PR #11896 records the gate going red and being repaired. The failing
+    step and the repair's causal link were NOT read from the CI log, so the trigger is not verified.
+  src: "ci-learning:11896:clock-sweep-report (merge the shards, classify, deliver)"
+  cited: "2026-10-16"
